1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,600
Captions come from an <i>ordinary</i> SRT file,
burned into every frame.

2
00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:05,000
Long cues wrap to the safe area and sit on its bottom edge, so a platform's buttons never cover them.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:06,200
Overlapping cues stack &amp; the earlier one stays on top.

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:07,900
Same text, same frames, either package.
